{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1920840/extras/bac830559fcdf71a4110142420bd8773.avif?t=1758090220\" data-has-big width=1560 height=487 /></span><strong>An extinction event took place.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luccia is one of the few survivors of an invasion by an ancient race called the &quot;Glithe&quot;.\u00a0<br>She nearly died, but managed to escape by mere chance.<br>\u00a0<br>Only a few humans remain living in isolation and those that are found are used for labor, pleasure, or worse... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Luccia, a warrior torn from her home, with only her friend Rhed they must stop the extinction, <i>even if that means Luccia must repopulate the human race...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1920840/extras/5bc8d7be8e1a59ef819fa824c7a0ad86.avif?t=1758090220\" data-has-big width=1560 height=487 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>As an action RPG, Heavy Hearts will challenge you against various foes, bosses, and super bosses. Each one is uniquely crafted and suited to force Luccia to use various skills in her arsenal.</strong>\u00a0</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strike your opponent</strong>'s with Luccia's trusty blade, the Claymost.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Charge your Aether</strong> and disintegrate foe's with magic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infuse Elements</strong> into your attacks to exploit enemy weaknesses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use precision heavy strikes</strong> at the right moment to finish monsters off</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beware of lewd traps</strong> that could slow Luccia down!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1920840/extras/21c4050f9696ae90dc322b17eac2ba0a.avif?t=1758090220\" data-has-big width=1560 height=487 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>With 16 explorable realms</strong> over two continents, there will be much to traverse as the quest continues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect rare items</strong> in combat, or throughout the realm. Use them to advance other quests or to trade for upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find exciting denizens</strong> along the way that have unclear motives, but just might help you under the right conditions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trust nobody</strong> - Humans are rare finds these days. Don't give anyone a chance to turn you in.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sneak around the villages or use a disguise</strong> - This way, Luccia is safe from being discovered. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1920840/extras/a2eb29ba58c7c8cbab1f66e00bd36bd7.avif?t=1758090220\" data-has-big width=1560 height=487 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Meet fantastical, diverse mythological races across the land of Arteria</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Make lasting relationships with your team mates, and maybe some enemies too.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Conversate with your  teammates, and build friendships into something more... <br></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamst